WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:17.416
"She who controls death... cannot know the experience of dying"

00:00:17.816 --> 00:00:20.741
*cough*... *cough*...

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:29.284
So...

00:00:30.506 --> 00:00:33.075
This is what death feels like

00:00:37.409 --> 00:00:38.715
Humans

00:00:38.715 --> 00:00:40.249
Gods

00:00:40.539 --> 00:00:42.408
Even ██████...

00:00:42.781 --> 00:00:45.574
I need not despise you any longer

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:53.239
Respond to the mother of all forbidden creations...

00:00:54.213 --> 00:00:57.928
Hidden by Hyperborea in the depths of the Shadow Realm ——

00:00:58.859 --> 00:01:01.449
The "Eitr"...

00:01:20.334 --> 00:01:23.421
Take this feeling with the hallowing of soil

00:01:24.700 --> 00:01:27.231
And give them to the world...

00:01:29.009 --> 00:01:31.409
...This is my parting gift

